@startuml
title VOPC - UC-16 Unified workload environment variables
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class "Workload editor / inline dialogs" as UI <<boundary>>
class "Workload configuration" as Config <<control>>
class "Reference catalog" as Catalog <<control>>
class "UC-12 Configuration" as Keys <<control>>
class "UC-01 Environment" as Env <<control>>
class "Desired workload change" as Change <<entity>>
class "Trusted ordinary-binding provenance" as Provenance <<entity>>
interface "Desired configuration store" as Store
UI --> Catalog : scoped safe source metadata
UI --> Keys : explicit create-only key
UI --> Env : explicit initial Secret Store save
UI --> UI : new shared ID / existing scoped selection
UI --> UI : dependency added to local draft
UI --> Config : validate/save/delete workload
Keys --> Store : CAS configuration revision
Config --> Catalog : verify Type params and references
Config --> Store : CAS pending change + provenance
Store ..> Change
Store ..> Provenance
@enduml
